  "tip": "<p>When a question emphasizes a tight cutover and a clear rollback, look for patterns that keep the source as the <i>system of record</i> while streaming changes into the target. In GCP that usually pairs <i>Datastream</i> with <i>Dataflow</i> and the destination’s migration tool.</p>",
